  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Initiating Website Design**\n\nI\'m starting the process of designing a modern institutional website for Albuquerque Guerra Advogados. I\'m focusing on incorporating all requested sections and features to build a sophisticated and comprehensive platform. The goal is to build a modern website for the firm. I aim to create something breathtaking.\n\n\n**Designing the AG Website**\n\nI\'ve been working on the header design for the AG website, aiming for a professional and contemporary look. The official SVG logo is ready, and I\'ve established the navigation with all key sections. The \"Fale conosco\" button has a champagne border and hover effect. I\'m also planning a full-screen mobile menu and a sticky header with a blur effect. The next step is the hero section, with a cinematic and asymmetrical layout.\n\n\n**Developing the Hero Section**\n\nI\'m now focused on the hero section and envisioning its key elements. I\'m incorporating a 3D \"AG\" monogram with a rotating champagne metallic finish and subtle ambient light for a modern and captivating effect. The location indicator \"Recife \342\200\242 PE,\" and sub-label \"Contencioso e consultivo jur\303\255dico\" will provide important context. I\'m also including a scroll indicator and section numbering, aiming for a user-friendly and visually appealing experience.\n\n\n**Crafting Key Value Panels**\n\nI\'m now diving into the \"Tr\303\255ade de Valores\" section, planning an interactive selector with expandable content and sleek animations for each pillar: Dilig\303\252ncia, Transpar\303\252ncia, and Compromisso com o Conhecimento. I aim to create a dynamic section that highlights the firm\'s core values effectively. I\'ll include full stories for each pillar, as requested, with details like weekly follow-ups and timeline animations for Dilig\303\252ncia, and monthly reports for Transpar\303\252ncia.\n\n\n**Building the People Section**\n\nI\'m now building the \"Pessoas\" section, starting with editorial cards for the team. I\'m focusing on Renata, Cl\303\241udia, and Jo\303\243o, each with professional portraits and expandable biographies. Each biography will have a \"Conhe\303\247a a trajet\303\263ria\" button and a subtle hover depth effect. I will strictly adhere to ethical guidelines, and Jo\303\243o Guerra will be marked as \"S\303\263cio\" with an updated biography.\n\n\n**Constructing the Contact Section**\n\nI\'m now integrating the contact details, including a functional form with input validation and a privacy checkbox. I\'m focusing on clean modularity, organizing code within the `/src/components/` and `/src/data/` directories for maintainability and best practices. I will start by updating the `index.html` file to add Google Fonts. I\'m preparing a detailed contact section. I\'ll include the footer with the necessary copyright notices and quick links.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 779129552
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
