    thinking: "**Reviewing Requirements Achieved**\n\nI\'ve confirmed both compilation and linting processes are successful, with no issues detected. Now, I am cross-referencing our efforts to all the user requirements, particularly the creation of a full, cutting-edge, visually impactful institutional website for Albuquerque Guerra Advogados.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully developed the institutional website for **Albuquerque Guerra Advogados**, featuring a sophisticated, modern, and cinematic design tailored to the firm\'s identity in Recife, PE.\n\n### Key Highlights & Features Implemented:\n- **Visual Identity & Editorial Elegance**: Crafted with a refined palette featuring dark green-black (`#101616`), deep greens (`#374544`), and champagne accents (`#D8CBB3`), paired with Cormorant Garamond serif headings and Manrope body typography.\n- **Cinematic Hero**: Asymmetrical layout featuring professional office imagery, 3D AG monogram emblem, and direct anchors to practice areas and firm essence.\n- **Integrated Practice Areas**: Interactive cards detailing Labor & Social Security, Tax, Civil/Real Estate/Consumer, and Third Sector law with detailed modals.\n- **Tr\303\255ade de Valores (Dilig\303\252ncia, Transpar\303\252ncia e Conhecimento)**: Comprehensive interactive showcase with full stories and systematic follow-up principles.\n- **Mission & Vision Switcher**: Toggle between the firm\'s strategic purpose and its vision for social transformation through law.\n- **Workflow & Methodology**: 4-step dynamic timeline (Compreender, Planejar, Atuar, Acompanhar).\n- **Professional Team Section**: Profiles for Renata Albuquerque, Cl\303\241udia Albuquerque, and Jo\303\243o Guerra with strict adherence to institutional ethics.\n- **Institutional Gallery & Contact**: Asymmetric photo gallery, complete contact information for the Recife office, and a fully validated inquiry form."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 514734333
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
