    thinking: "**Exploring Color & Style**\n\nI\'m now considering how to enhance this while staying within a defined color palette, but with a more creative and bold, yet professional, approach suitable for lawyers. I\'m exploring visual effects, including 3D elements, to achieve a sophisticated aesthetic.\n\n\n**Refining Visual Enhancements**\n\nI\'m now implementing the plan for visual enhancements. My current focus is on adding striking 3D elements, such as an interactive monogram and glassmorphic cards with depth, all while maintaining a sophisticated and professional aesthetic. I\'m exploring CSS and React for the interactive 3D rotation, and considering parallax depth and glowing accents. I\'m actively working on cinematic effects and refining typography for optimal contrast and elegance. The goal is a visually bold, yet conservative design. I am now working on `src/components/Hero.tsx`.\n\n\n"
