  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Aesthetic Vision**\n\nI am now focusing on integrating visual effects and 3D elements to enhance the site\'s elegance. The goal is to elevate Albuquerque Guerra Advogados\' luxurious editorial style with cutting-edge visual techniques.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "The following action was requested:\nView contents of file /src/index.css from lines 1 to 60The action produced the following result:\nFile Path: `/src/index.css`\nTotal Lines: 60\nTotal Bytes: 1251\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.The following action was requested:\nEdit file /src/index.cssThe action produced the following result:\nThe following changes were made by an unspecified tool call (nil ToolCall) to: /src/index.css.\n[diff_block_start]\n@@ -57,3 +57,21 @@\n   background: #D8CBB3;\n }\n \n+/* Advanced Visual Glow & Glass Effects */\n+.glow-card {\n+  position: relative;\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+}\n+.glow-card::before {\n+  content: \'\';\n+  position: absolute;\n+  top: -50%;\n+  left: -50%;\n+  width: 200%;\n+  height: 200%;\n+  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(216,203,179,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);\n+  opacity: 0;\n+  transition: opacity 0.5s ease;\n+  pointer-events: none;\n+}\n+.glow-card:hover::before {\n+  opacity: 1;\n+}\n[diff_block_end]\n\nPlease note that the above snippet only shows the MODIFIED lines from the last change. It shows up to 3 lines of unchanged lines before and after the modified lines. The actual file contents may have many more lines not shown.The following action was requested:\nCreate file /src/components/PracticeAreas.tsxThe action produced the following result:\nSuccessfully created file /src/components/PracticeAreas.tsx with content:\nimport React, { useState } from \'react\';\nimport { Briefcase, Landmark, Home, Users, ArrowUpRight, Sparkles } from \'lucide-react\';\nimport { DetailModal } from \'./DetailModal\';\nimport { PracticeArea } from \'../types\';\n\nexport const PracticeAreas: React.FC = () => {\n  const [selectedArea, setSelectedArea] = useState<PracticeArea | null>(null);\n\n  const areas: PracticeArea[] = [\n    {\n      id: \'trabalhista\',\n      number: \'01\',\n      title: \'Direito Trabalhista e Previdenci\303\241rio\',\n      summary: \'Oferecemos uma ampla gama de servi\303\247os jur\303\255dicos relacionados ao Direito Trabalhista e Previdenci\303\241rio, incluindo compliance trabalhista, consultoria, representa\303\247\303\243o judicial e extrajudicial, negocia\303\247\303\243o coletiva e individual.\',\n      fullContent: \'Oferecemos uma ampla gama de servi\303\247os jur\303\255dicos relacionados ao Direito Trabalhista e Previdenci\303\241rio, incluindo compliance trabalhista, consultoria, representa\303\247\303\243o judicial e extrajudicial, negocia\303\247\303\243o coletiva e individual, entre outros.\\n\\nNossa abordagem combina rigor preventivo com atua\303\247\303\243o firme perante os \303\263rg\303\243os de justi\303\247a, garantindo seguran\303\247a nas rela\303\247\303\265es de trabalho e prote\303\247\303\243o aos direitos previdenci\303\241rios com foco na previsibilidade financeira e organizacional das empresas e clientes.\',\n      iconName: \'Briefcase\',\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'tributario\',\n      number: \'02\',\n      title: \'Direito Tribut\303\241rio\',\n      summary: \'Oferecemos consultoria e representa\303\247\303\243o jur\303\255dica em quest\303\265es relacionadas ao Direito Tribut\303\241rio, incluindo planejamento tribut\303\241rio e defesa em processos administrativos e judiciais.\',\n      fullContent: \'Oferecemos consultoria e representa\303\247\303\243o jur\303\255dica em quest\303\265es relacionadas ao Direito Tribut\303\241rio, incluindo planejamento tribut\303\241rio, revis\303\243o de cargas fiscais, mitiga\303\247\303\243o de riscos de autua\303\247\303\243o e defesa em processos administrativos e judiciais nas esferas municipal, estadual e federal.\\n\\nBuscamos otimizar a estrutura fiscal com estrita observ\303\242ncia \303\240 legalidade, proporcionando economia leg\303\255tima e seguran\303\247a jur\303\255dica duradoura.\',\n      iconName: \'Landmark\',\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'civil\',\n      number: \'03\',\n      title: \'Direito Civil, Imobili\303\241rio e do Consumidor\',\n      summary: \'Oferecemos consultoria e representa\303\247\303\243o jur\303\255dica em quest\303\265es relacionadas ao Direito Civil, Imobili\303\241rio e do Consumidor, nos Tribunais de Justi\303\247a, Juizados Especiais e unidades cartor\303\241rias.\',\n      fullContent: \'Oferecemos consultoria e representa\303\247\303\243o jur\303\255dica em quest\303\265es relacionadas ao Direito Civil, Imobili\303\241rio e do Consumidor, nos Tribunais de Justi\303\247a, Juizados Especiais e unidades cartor\303\241rias.\\n\\nAtuamos na estrutura\303\247\303\243o e revis\303\243o de contratos, contencioso c\303\255vel estrat\303\251gico, regulariza\303\247\303\243o de im\303\263veis, disputas possess\303\263rias e rela\303\247\303\265es de consumo, sempre priorizando a resolu\303\247\303\243o c\303\251lere e vantajosa dos conflitos.\',\n      iconName: \'Home\',\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'terceiro-setor\',\n      number: \'04\',\n      title: \'Terceiro Setor\',\n      summary: \'Fornecemos servi\303\247os jur\303\255dicos especializados para organiza\303\247\303\265es do Terceiro Setor, incluindo orienta\303\247\303\243o para a cria\303\247\303\243o de entidades, elabora\303\247\303\243o de estatutos e obten\303\247\303\243o de certifica\303\247\303\265es.\',\n      fullContent: \'Fornecemos servi\303\247os jur\303\255dicos especializados para organiza\303\247\303\265es do Terceiro Setor, incluindo orienta\303\247\303\243o para a cria\303\247\303\243o de entidades, elabora\303\247\303\243o de estatutos, obten\303\247\303\243o de certifica\303\247\303\265es (como CEBAS, utilidade p\303\272blica), estrutura\303\247\303\243o jur\303\255dica, parcerias com o Poder P\303\272blico e acompanhamento de suas atividades estatut\303\241rias.\\n\\nApoiamos o ecossistema de impacto social com dedica\303\247\303\243o institucional e rigor normativo.\',\n      iconName: \'Users\',\n    },\n  ];\n\n  const getIcon = (iconName: string) => {\n    switch (iconName) {\n      case \'Briefcase\': return <Briefcase className=\"w-6 h-6\" />;\n      case \'Landmark\': return <Landmark className=\"w-6 h-6\" />;\n      case \'Home\': return <Home className=\"w-6 h-6\" />;\n      case \'Users\': return <Users className=\"w-6 h-6\" />;\n      default: return <Briefcase className=\"w-6 h-6\" />;\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <section id=\"atuacao\" className=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#101616] relative overflow-hidden\">\n      <div className=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.03] bg-[radial-gradient(#D8CBB3_1.5px,transparent_1.5px)] [background-size:28px_28px] pointer-events-none\" />\n      <div className=\"absolute top-1/3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[40rem] h-[40rem] bg-[#374544]/20 rounded-full blur-[150px] pointer-events-none\" />\n\n      <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 relative z-10\">\n        \n        {/* Section Header */}\n        <div className=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-16 pb-8 border-b border-[#D8CBB3]/20\">\n          <div>\n            <span className=\"text-[#D8CBB3] font-serif text-sm tracking-widest flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n              <Sparkles className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n              03 / \303\201REAS DE ATUA\303\207\303\203O\n            </span>\n            <h2 className=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-[#FFFDF8] font-light max-w-2xl leading-tight\">\n              Atua\303\247\303\243o jur\303\255dica integrada e <span className=\"text-[#D8CBB3] italic\">estrat\303\251gica.</span>\n            </h2>\n          </div>\n          <p className=\"text-[#F6F3EC]/70 text-sm md:text-base max-w-md mt-6 md:mt-0 font-light leading-relaxed\">\n            Solu\303\247\303\265es robustas para empresas, institui\303\247\303\265es e particulares, alinhando rigor t\303\251cnico e vis\303\243o de neg\303\263cios.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* 4 Large Interactive Glow Cards Grid */}\n        <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\">\n          {areas.map((area) => (\n            <div\n              key={area.id}\n              onClick={() => setSelectedArea(area)}\n              className=\"glow-card p-8 md:p-10 rounded-3xl bg-[#151f1f]/80 border border-[#D8CBB3]/20 hover:border-[#D8CBB3]/60 transition-all duration-500 group cursor-pointer flex flex-col justify-between shadow-2xl hover:-translate-y-1.5 backdrop-blur-xl\"\n            >\n              <div>\n                <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8\">\n                  <div className=\"w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#374544] to-[#101616] border border-[#D8CBB3]/40 flex items-center justify-center text-[#D8CBB3] group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:bg-[#D8CBB3] group-hover:text-[#101616] transition-all duration-300 shadow-xl\">\n                    {getIcon(area.iconName)}\n                  </div>\n                  <span className=\"font-serif text-3xl text-[#D8CBB3]/40 group-hover:text-[#D8CBB3] transition-colors font-light\">\n                    {area.number}\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n\n                <h3 className=\"text-2xl font-serif text-[#FFFDF8] mb-4 group-hover:text-[#D8CBB3] transition-colors leading-snug\">\n                  {area.title}\n                </h3>\n\n                <p className=\"text-[#F6F3EC]/80 text-base font-light leading-relaxed mb-6\">\n                  {area.summary}\n                </p>\n              </div>\n\n              <div className=\"pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <span className=\"text-sm font-medium text-[#D8CBB3] tracking-wide group-hover:translate-x-1.5 transition-transform inline-flex items-center gap-2\">\n                  Ver detalhes completos\n                  <ArrowUpRight className=\"w-4 h-4\" />\n                </span>\n                <span className=\"text-xs text-[#F6F3EC]/50 uppercase tracking-widest font-sans\">\n                  Albuquerque Guerra\n                </span>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <DetailModal\n        isOpen={!!selectedArea}\n        onClose={() => setSelectedArea(null)}\n        title={selectedArea?.title || \'\'}\n        subtitle={`\303\201rea de Atua\303\247\303\243o ${selectedArea?.number}`}\n        content={selectedArea?.fullContent || \'\'}\n      />\n    </section>\n  );\n};\nThe following action was requested:\nCreate file /src/components/ValuesTriad.tsxThe action produced the following result:\nSuccessfully created file /src/components/ValuesTriad.tsx with content:\nimport React, { useState } from \'react\';\nimport { ArrowRight, Sparkles } from \'lucide-react\';\nimport { DetailModal } from \'./DetailModal\';\nimport { ValueItem } from \'../types\';\n\nexport const ValuesTriad: React.FC = () => {\n  const [activeTab, setActiveTab] = useState<number>(0);\n  const [selectedModalValue, setSelectedModalValue] = useState<ValueItem | null>(null);\n\n  const values: ValueItem[] = [\n    {\n      id: \'diligencia\',\n      number: \'01\',\n      title: \'Dilig\303\252ncia\',\n      subtitle: \'Acompanhamento sistem\303\241tico e constante\',\n      summary: \'Acompanhamento sistem\303\241tico e constante para que aquilo que est\303\241 sob o nosso controle contribua para o andamento do processo.\',\n      fullContent: `Desde o in\303\255cio, sempre fizemos quest\303\243o de sistematizar nossa abordagem no impulsionamento dos processos que nos s\303\243o confiados. N\303\243o admitimos que as a\303\247\303\265es fiquem soltas, \303\240 disposi\303\247\303\243o da boa vontade do \303\223rg\303\243o Julgador. Afinal, se o interessado no andamento do feito \303\251 o nosso cliente, n\303\243o poder\303\255amos deix\303\241-lo \303\240 merc\303\252 da justi\303\247a.\n\nQuando a celeridade \303\251 o interesse, as dilig\303\252ncias s\303\243o realizadas semanalmente.\n\nEm cada processo em que advogamos, do primeiro ao \303\272ltimo dia de tramita\303\247\303\243o, realizamos dilig\303\252ncias semanais em busca do pr\303\263ximo passo. A cada semana, em cada processo, promovemos um novo contato com os serventu\303\241rios da justi\303\247a, auxiliares, chefes de secretaria, assessores e magistrados, sempre de forma sistematizada e mediante procedimentos padronizados.\n\nCom isso, minimizam-se as chances de o processo ficar parado. Se muitas s\303\243o as vari\303\241veis que podem interferir negativamente no andamento processual, como a sobrecarga da justi\303\247a ou a postura adotada pela parte contr\303\241ria, nossa atua\303\247\303\243o n\303\243o pode ser mais uma delas. Aquilo que est\303\241 sob o nosso controle deve contribuir, nunca prejudicar.\n\nCom essa postura, formamos o primeiro de nossos valores: a dilig\303\252ncia. Conhecemos o valor do tempo e sabemos da import\303\242ncia de maximizar o seu aproveitamento.`,\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'transparencia\',\n      number: \'02\',\n      title: \'Transpar\303\252ncia\',\n      subtitle: \'Informa\303\247\303\243o constante para preservar a confian\303\247a\',\n      summary: \'Informa\303\247\303\243o constante para preservar a confian\303\247a e permitir que o cliente acompanhe e planeje os pr\303\263ximos passos.\',\n      fullContent: `Sem exce\303\247\303\243o, cada cliente que nos demanda recebe mensalmente relat\303\263rios com os \303\272ltimos andamentos e com as provid\303\252ncias pendentes. A cada m\303\252s, o destinat\303\241rio de nossos servi\303\247os \303\251 espontaneamente informado, ainda que n\303\243o venha a perguntar, sobre aquilo que foi realizado e sobre aquilo que dever\303\241 ser feito.\n\nDessa forma, mantemos os nossos clientes sempre informados, evitando o elemento surpresa e viabilizando o planejamento de suas decis\303\265es.\n\nAl\303\251m disso, permanecemos \303\240 disposi\303\247\303\243o para responder aos questionamentos e pedidos de informa\303\247\303\243o apresentados.\n\nCom essa postura, evidenciamos o segundo de nossos valores: a transpar\303\252ncia.\n\nTrata-se de um valor necess\303\241rio para retribuir a confian\303\247a que nossos clientes depositam em nossos servi\303\247os. Afinal, enquanto a confian\303\247a est\303\241 sempre presente no ato da contrata\303\247\303\243o, sem transpar\303\252ncia n\303\243o pode haver confian\303\247a.\n\nA dilig\303\252ncia orienta o monitoramento e o impulsionamento semanal dos processos. A transpar\303\252ncia, por sua vez, orienta a apresenta\303\247\303\243o de relat\303\263rios mensais e garante disponibilidade constante para os destinat\303\241rios de nossas atividades. Tudo em prol da retribui\303\247\303\243o e da preserva\303\247\303\243o da confian\303\247a depositada na contrata\303\247\303\243o de nossos servi\303\247os.`,\n    },\n    {\n      id: \'conhecimento\',\n      number: \'03\',\n      title: \'Compromisso com o Conhecimento\',\n      subtitle: \'Aprendizado constante e atualiza\303\247\303\243o cont\303\255nua\',\n      summary: \'O conhecimento jur\303\255dico est\303\241 em constante transforma\303\247\303\243o. Por isso, aprender, pesquisar e se atualizar fazem parte da nossa forma de atuar.\',\n      fullContent: `Nossa atividade est\303\241 em constante transforma\303\247\303\243o. Lidamos diariamente com as mais variadas normas produzidas, alteradas ou revogadas e com as mais diversas decis\303\265es proferidas ou reformadas pelos julgadores e tribunais.\n\nUm entendimento que existia ontem pode j\303\241 n\303\243o existir hoje e talvez volte a existir amanh\303\243. Existe uma l\303\263gica jur\303\255dica e uma ci\303\252ncia por tr\303\241s dessa din\303\242mica, mas o conhecimento com o qual trabalhamos est\303\241 em constante muta\303\247\303\243o.\n\nPor isso, a vontade de aprender, pesquisar e se atualizar \303\251 uma caracter\303\255stica necess\303\241ria e sempre presente em nossa atua\303\247\303\243o. A sede pelo conhecimento, que constitui o terceiro de nossos valores, dirige e orienta nossa atividade, sempre com o prop\303\263sito de construir e entregar a melhor solu\303\247\303\243o ao destinat\303\241rio de nossos servi\303\247os: o cliente.\n\nBuscamos tamb\303\251m acompanhar a evolu\303\247\303\243o tecnol\303\263gica e os impactos que ela produz em nossas atividades. Da padroniza\303\247\303\243o de procedimentos e sistemas operacionais ao uso adequado e supervisionado da intelig\303\252ncia artificial, nossas escolhas s\303\243o sempre voltadas \303\240 entrega do melhor resultado.\n\nO passar do tempo nunca poder\303\241 permitir que fiquemos satisfeitos com o conhecimento at\303\251 ent\303\243o adquirido. N\303\243o admitimos a estagna\303\247\303\243o.\n\nCom isso, completamos a tr\303\255ade de valores que orienta nossa atua\303\247\303\243o: dilig\303\252ncia, transpar\303\252ncia e compromisso com o conhecimento.`,\n    },\n  ];\n\n  const currentVal = values[activeTab];\n\n  return (\n    <section id=\"valores\" className=\"py-24 md:py-32 bg-[#151f1f] relative overflow-hidden\">\n      <div className=\"absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-96 h-96 bg-[#D8CBB3]/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none\" />\n\n      <div className=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 relative z-10\">\n        \n        {/* Section Header */}\n        <div className=\"text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16\">\n          <span className=\"text-[#D8CBB3] font-serif text-sm tracking-widest flex items-center justify-center gap-2 mb-3\">\n            <Sparkles className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n            04 / TR\303\215ADE DE VALORES\n          </span>\n          <h2 className=\"text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif text-[#FFFDF8] font-light mb-6 leading-tight\">\n            Transpar\303\252ncia, dilig\303\252ncia e sede pelo <span className=\"text-[#D8CBB3] italic\">conhecimento.</span>\n          </h2>\n          <p className=\"text-[#F6F3EC]/80 text-base md:text-lg font-light leading-relaxed\">\n            Pautamos nossos procedimentos nesta tr\303\255ade de valores por entendermos que, dessa forma, conseguimos entregar o melhor resultado.\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Tab Buttons Selector */}\n        <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 md:gap-4 mb-12\">\n          {values.map((val, idx) => (\n            <button\n              key={val.id}\n              onClick={() => setActiveTab(idx)}\n              className={`px-6 py-4 rounded-2xl text-sm md:text-base font-medium transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-3 border ${\n                activeTab === idx\n                  ? \'bg-[#D8CBB3] text-[#101616] border-[#D8CBB3] shadow-2xl scale-105\'\n                  : \'bg-[#101616]/70 text-[#F6F3EC] border-[#D8CBB3]/20 hover:border-[#D8CBB3]/60\'\n              }`}\n            >\n              <span className={`text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-semibold ${activeTab === idx ? \'bg-[#101616]/20 text-[#101616]\' : \'bg-[#374544] text-[#D8CBB3]\'}`}>\n                {val.number}\n              </span>\n              <span>{val.title}</span>\n            </button>\n          ))}\n        </div>\n\n        {/* Active Value Showcase Card */}\n        <div className=\"glow-card p-8 md:p-14 rounded-3xl bg-[#101616]/95 border border-[#D8CBB3]/40 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden backdrop-blur-xl animate-fadeIn\">\n          <div className=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-8 opacity-10 text-[#D8CBB3] pointer-events-none hidden md:block\">\n            <span className=\"font-serif text-[12rem] font-bold leading-none\">{currentVal.number}</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-center\">\n            <div className=\"lg:col-span-8 space-y-6\">\n              <div className=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#374544] text-[#D8CBB3] text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase border border-[#D8CBB3]/30 shadow-sm\">\n                <Sparkles className=\"w-3.5 h-3.5\" />\n                <span>Valor Fundamental {currentVal.number}</span>\n              </div>\n\n              <h3 className=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif text-[#FFFDF8]\">\n                {currentVal.title}\n              </h3>\n\n              <p className=\"text-xl font-serif italic text-[#D8CBB3]\">\n                \"{currentVal.subtitle}\"\n              </p>\n\n              <p className=\"text-[#F6F3EC]/90 text-lg font-light leading-relaxed\">\n                {currentVal.summary}\n              </p>\n\n              <div className=\"pt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n                <button\n                  onClick={() => setSelectedModalValue(currentVal)}\n                  className=\"px-7 py-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#D8CBB3] hover:bg-[#FFFDF8] text-[#101616] font-semibold text-sm transition-all shadow-xl hover:scale-105 flex items-center gap-3 group\"\n                >\n                  <span>Conhe\303\247a este valor em detalhes</span>\n                  <ArrowRight className=\"w-4 h-4 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform\" />\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"lg:col-span-4 flex items-center justify-center\">\n              <div className=\"w-full h-64 md:h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative border border-[#D8CBB3]/40 shadow-2xl group\">\n                <img\n                  src={\n                    activeTab === 0\n                      ? \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80\"\n                      : activeTab === 1\n                      ? \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507679799987-c73779587ccf?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80\"\n                      : \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80\"\n                  }\n                  alt={currentVal.title}\n                  className=\"w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-700 filter contrast-[1.05]\"\n                />\n                <div className=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-[#101616] via-transparent to-transparent opacity-80\" />\n                <div className=\"absolute bottom-4 left-4 right-4 text-center\">\n                  <span className=\"text-xs text-[#D8CBB3] font-serif uppercase tracking-widest\">\n                    Albuquerque Guerra Advogados\n                  </span>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <DetailModal\n        isOpen={!!selectedModalValue}\n        onClose={() => setSelectedModalValue(null)}\n        title={selectedModalValue?.title || \'\'}\n        subtitle={selectedModalValue?.subtitle}\n        content={selectedModalValue?.fullContent || \'\'}\n      />\n    </section>\n  );\n};\nThe following action was requested:\nBuilding applet...The action produced the following result:\nBuild succeeded - the applet is compiled\nAn initial response was provided to the user. Now, I will summarize the work completed successfully.I have completed the enhancements to the **Albuquerque Guerra Advogados** institutional website, delivering a high-end, ultra-faithful, and visually immersive experience:\n\n- **Ultra-Faithful Official Logomark & High-Definition Monogram**: Integrated the official arched brand emblem in high-definition SVG with a transparent background across the header, 3D hero showcase, and footer.\n- **Cinematic 3D & Visual Depth**: Enhanced the interactive 3D monogram hero showcase with smooth tilt physics, subtle ambient lighting, glowing card effects, and orbital animations.\n- **Comprehensive Institutional Sections**:\n  - Full institutional header with responsive full-screen mobile menu.\n  - Cinematic asymmetric hero with strategic value propositions.\n  - Detailed presentation of the firm and its 4 conceptual pillars.\n  - Interactive practice areas with animated cards and modal depth views.\n  - Interactive Values Triad (Diligence, Transparency, Knowledge).\n  - Dynamic Mission & Vision tab switcher.\n  - 4-step professional workflow timeline.\n  - Professional team cards with expansion and high-resolution portraits (Renata, Cl\303\241udia, and Jo\303\243o).\n  - Asymmetric institutional gallery with lightbox zoom.\n  - Fully functional inquiry form with LGPD privacy acceptance and contact cards for Recife/PE."
