    thinking: "**Composing the Final Summary**\n\nI\'ve just added React Router to the application, creating dynamic routing. Furthermore, I implemented the \"ACESSO ADMINISTRATIVO\" button in both the desktop and mobile navigation menus for easy access.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully created the structure for the complete administrative panel. Since this is an extensive feature involving a full backend and frontend implementation, I have completed the first and most crucial phase: the **Routing, Navigation, and Interface Layout**.\n\nHere is what was accomplished in this turn:\n- **Navigation & Routing**: Implemented `react-router-dom` to handle public and administrative routes seamlessly without reloading the page.\n- **Acesso Administrativo Button**: Added the elegant access button to both the desktop header and the mobile menu, adhering perfectly to the site\'s dark/champagne aesthetic.\n- **Secure Login Screen**: Created the `/admin/login` view with a polished interface, including inputs for email and password, a show/hide password toggle, and the requested options (password recovery and keep logged in).\n- **Responsive Admin Dashboard**: Built the complete layout for `/admin` featuring:\n  - A responsive sidebar with all the requested modules (Identidade visual, P\303\241gina inicial, O escrit\303\263rio, \303\201reas de atua\303\247\303\243o, Equipe, Galeria, etc.).\n  - A mobile-friendly overlay menu.\n  - A \"Vis\303\243o geral\" dashboard showing site status and statistics.\n  - A foundational architecture ready to receive the real data.\n\n### Next Steps for the Backend (Database & Auth)\nYou requested the use of **Supabase**. Please note that in this AI Studio environment, I cannot automatically provision a Supabase project on your behalf. \n\nTo proceed with the backend integration, we have two options:\n1. **(Recommended)** Allow me to provision a **Firebase** project natively using my automated tools. Firebase offers the exact same requested features (Firebase Auth, Firestore Database, and Cloud Storage for the media library) and can be set up immediately.\n2. If you strictly require **Supabase**, you will need to manually create a Supabase project and provide me with the `SUPABASE_URL` and `SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`. \n\nLet me know if you would like me to proceed automatically with Firebase, or if you prefer to provide your Supabase credentials!"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 649136729
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
