 management dashboard. Here, administrators can list, filter, search, view metrics, and access the \"Adicionar Evento\" layout. \n    - **Formul\303\241rio de Cadastro**: Added the interface for creating an event, including layout selections for artwork format detection, draft/publish controls, modality selectors, and detailed descriptive inputs."
